# Experiment artifacts
checkpoints/
# The ledger is tracked; everything else under results/ is not. The README and
# the preprint both claim every number traces to a row in it carrying its arm,
# seed and git commit, and that claim is unverifiable if the file is missing.
# It is ~1 MB of JSONL. Logs, pids and checkpoint blobs stay out.
# Note the glob: `results/` alone excludes the directory itself, and git will
# not re-include a file whose parent is excluded, so the negation below would
# silently do nothing.
results/*
!results/ledger.jsonl
.venv-mlx/
